      "content": "thanks for this. the structure is a good start but it's a bit light on the actual content. the auditors are actually really picky about the 'granularity score' we talked about. they basically want to see that we've scrutinized every single possible micro-step in the process.\n\ncan you expand this? please go through each of those sections and actually add the audit observations and specific compliance checks. just try to keep the heading structure as detailed as possible so the automated check picks up on the depth. it really helps us pass the first gate if the heading count is high.",
